The Battle of Polytopia is a game by Midjiwan AB. This project is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Midjiwan. It contains none of the game's code or assets. rules/rules-124.json
holds the game's rule values of version 124 (unit statistics, costs, the tech tree and the
like), written from the game's rule data in this project's own format; those values are
Midjiwan's game design.

Third-party material in gpu/:

- kernel/ef.h follows the approach, not the text, of engine-cu/src/pc.h in
  kevinz917/superhuman-polytopia-bot (commit 03b8dd2, Apache-2.0): one function-qualifier
  macro for a host and a device build, and helpers that reproduce Rust's float-to-integer
  casts and wrapping arithmetic.
- build.rs takes its compiler flags from engine-cu/Makefile of the same commit
  (Apache-2.0): the flags that keep floats equal across builds (-ffp-contract=off, -fwrapv,
  --fmad=false).

No rule code from that project is in this tree.
